{"steam_appid":3761880,"steam_name":"Night Shippers","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3761880/2085800351/bc6e081c05229803d04ae1b488e4ba77c1717f10/1765950052/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1765950836","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257251194/3596a8bf741a565b13c5f476f7062a74f3171e99/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1765950836","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761880/f35455ec6a04ae05c24a58206b50f3946a6bf93a/ss_f35455ec6a04ae05c24a58206b50f3946a6bf93a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1781524054","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761880/7630ac14c8fe0c1740182835fae21caa1115db6e/ss_7630ac14c8fe0c1740182835fae21caa1115db6e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1781524054","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761880/210d0d1ae93fcb9a2ad07f9e03dfffa1bc9254f8/ss_210d0d1ae93fcb9a2ad07f9e03dfffa1bc9254f8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1781524054","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761880/4672cb27d50d89ee788581ed14b4d3d40453f08c/ss_4672cb27d50d89ee788581ed14b4d3d40453f08c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1781524054","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761880/20167545862f5be49af65efc554a4bc73d98d5db/ss_20167545862f5be49af65efc554a4bc73d98d5db.1920x1080.jpg?t=1781524054"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You signed up for a delivery job in hell. Finish the orders before sunrise - or the underworld will claim you forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761880/extras/a8987ade8ff4311e74bff2a0f64a9f98.webp?t=1781524054\" width=500 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761880/extras/dc25781507b7af62a42db1b8f2ffbd0e.poster.avif?t=1781524054\" width=500 height=281 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761880/extras/dc25781507b7af62a42db1b8f2ffbd0e.webm?t=1781524054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761880/extras/82494f53e413ba8fb44ea036a28f5048.poster.avif?t=1781524054\" width=500 height=281 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761880/extras/82494f53e413ba8fb44ea036a28f5048.webm?t=1781524054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Team up with up to 4 players to deliver &amp; experience the grind and hustle of being a food shipper - one of the most familiar jobs in Vietnam and Southeast Asia.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761880/extras/4fa7ff1ee6686a051c36d485bb8586c3.webp?t=1781524054\" width=500 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761880/extras/e5bafb9f524f04c33d0559297e7ec89c.poster.avif?t=1781524054\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761880/extras/e5bafb9f524f04c33d0559297e7ec89c.webm?t=1781524054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761880/extras/f3c3fc63abef3b83fdc7a2f7fe9f45a5.poster.avif?t=1781524054\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761880/extras/f3c3fc63abef3b83fdc7a2f7fe9f45a5.webm?t=1781524054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Dodge traps, outsmart monsters, and uncover hidden shortcuts to finish your deliveries before sunrise.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761880/extras/9ef0c80753e6e8d04b744f9b9529deab.webp?t=1781524054\" width=500 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761880/extras/ab70b91877d48069ed8519c13408db9a.poster.avif?t=1781524054\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761880/extras/ab70b91877d48069ed8519c13408db9a.webm?t=1781524054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761880/extras/ab70b91877d48069ed8519c13408db9a.mp4?t=1781524054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761880/extras/ba9231b14a94e2eb09eccfcfa16b9e03.poster.avif?t=1781524054\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761880/extras/ba9231b14a94e2eb09eccfcfa16b9e03.webm?t=1781524054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>No two nights are ever the same - weather, ghosts, and events are procedurally generated for endless replayability.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761880/extras/55dc78aacb5a35bee399432466abe745.webp?t=1781524054\" width=500 height=61 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761880/extras/2eb5a653d4ee7ebd0c23d5af837c9458.poster.avif?t=1781524054\" width=500 height=281 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761880/extras/2eb5a653d4ee7ebd0c23d5af837c9458.webm?t=1781524054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Earn money to unlock new gear, vehicles, and special delivery abilities that stack each night - giving you a fighting chance to survive longer.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i5-7400 CPU @ 3.00GHz or AMD Ryzen 5 1400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1050ti or AMD R9 270X<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i7-8700<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1070<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Casual","Simulation"],"developers":["Young Buffalo"],"publishers":["Young Buffalo"],"release_date":"6 Apr, 2026"}